WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:40.010
The Ideon defeated the alien Gil Bau fighters,

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:44.010
and the Heavy Mobile Mecha Zigg Mack, rescuing Bes and Karala.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:52.920
Nothing could hold back the warm
 feeling that formed between the two.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:58.930
<b>Shoot the Alien</b>

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.790
Don't neglect the anti-air surveillance!

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:23.330
Once we're in space, get into the stardust ahead!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:24.260
Roger.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:29.710
Hey Bes, why do our and the enemy's radar systems cancel each other out?

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.870
It might be because of the flow of electromagnetic waves.

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:33.340
I can't think of any other reason.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:34.040
Bes!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.480
Is that old laser sensor going to help us at all?

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:37.810
It's better than nothing!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:59.590
So you've ran out of patience, Logo Dau aliens.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:00.650
Lady Harulu.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:01.840
Guhaba?

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.260
The repairs on the Heavy Mobile Mecha are finished.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:05.280
One more battle.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.340
Please give me the chance for one more battle,

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:10.470
so that I can redeem myself.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:16.210
I've seen that the enemy's Giant conceals some sort of unknown power.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:20.150
I'm not saying it's the Ide, but it must be something similar.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:24.860
Take down the Giant, even if it costs your life. It should become clear then.

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:31.670
If you succeed, your family and followers shall be honored in the name of Doba Ajiba.

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:33.170
Thank you very much.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:36.520
You'll see results from me.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.520
You should rest a little and have some tea.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:45.730
Oh, thanks!

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:47.980
If anyone wants some milk in it, just say so.

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:50.070
Ms. Karala, why are you doing this?

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:52.770
I come from a samurai family.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:53.480
Karala!

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:54.990
Who asked you to do that?

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:56.120
No one...

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.420
There's a shortage of workers. What's the problem?

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:01.850
She's a Buff Clan woman who could betray us any moment.

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:04.770
I'm no longer one of the Buff Clan.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:07.070
Too bad for miss Karala, huh?

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.200
You just had to butt in.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.960
Kasha, she's trying her best too.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.500
Women should understand each other.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.830
Even if she pretends to be high classed, Karala is just a murderer's pawn!

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:20.790
A murderer's pawn!

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.070
Ashura!

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.200
Working hard, I see!

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:33.230
Ah! It's unusual to see you here.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.740
So, will we be able to prevent a food crisis?

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:39.360
Growing wheat is a simple task for a farmer.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.670
This is something the rest of us know nothing about.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:42.860
We're depending on you, Lotta.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:43.190
Yes!

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:44.960
Bes, so you're here.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:45.800
What is it?

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.590
Don't you think it's careless to let her wander around?

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:49.510
Who do you mean?

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.550
Karala, of course.

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:53.940
The men are starting to get a strange interest towards her.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.620
I'll tell her not to walk around like that.

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:58.420
Do you think of her as an ally now, Bes?

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.690
She's been abandoned by her own people.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.400
You're too sentimental about this.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.650
It could endanger the whole Solo Ship.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.070
She knows the enemy.

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.390
She should prove useful as a battle adviser.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:11.180
It's not worth talking to you.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:12.240
She's a human too!

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:13.830
She's an alien, isn't she?

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:14.970
Get rational.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:17.470
She's a human being!

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:21.520
That's right.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.890
The weeds have to be pulled out of the field!

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.250
Unit One, get set in the right position!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:36.760
Launch in five seconds!

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:37.540
Three,

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:38.420
two,

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.310
one,

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.120
zero!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:45.210
The Zurow Jicks have launched!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.890
The enemy hopes to use the Nimbus Zone as a shield.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.280
We'll chase them with the Zurow Jicks!

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.490
Zigg Mack, launch!

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:06.440
The Buff Clan Earth...

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.430
If my sister hadn't come, I might
have been able to return there.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.400
I am being hunted.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:26.520
That might be so...

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:29.130
But...

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.780
I have nowhere left to run.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.940
Are they charging into the Nimbus Zone?

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:44.370
Their course isn't changing. At this rate...

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:46.520
They're blissfully ignorant.

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:52.570
I knew it, there's no mistaking it!

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.340
There's a vehicle following the Solo Ship.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:55.740
Begin battle preparations!

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:56.390
Roger!

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.950
They've caught us again?!

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:02.200
What kind of tracking system do they possess?

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.150
Call Karala over here.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.660
Do you think she really knows anything?

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.810
You rely on her too much.

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:10.830
Hey!

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.500
The stardust is moving.

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:17.950
How many are there?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:18.780
I can't tell!

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:22.630
They're flowing against our direction in a belt-like region of 3 or 4000 kilometers.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:24.570
Will the Solo Ship be able to get through?

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:25.820
Take a look at this!

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.170
There's too many of them!

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:32.860
But if we hide there, we may be able to shake off the Buff Clan using the DS Drive.

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:35.910
A tremor!

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.640
It looks like we've entered an asteroid field!

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.430
Everyone sit down!

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.780
It's the aliens again!

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:53.220
I knew it, we can't track the enemy with our laser sensor in a place like this!

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:54.570
Bes, I'm taking off!

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:55.470
I'm counting on you!

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:57.740
The Solo Ship will head into the stardust!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.320
That's crazy!

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:00.680
We won't be able to get through!

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:01.620
It's too late now!

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.190
Wait! Cosmo, Kasha!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.350
I need to fight so we can survive!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:05.860
Me too!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:06.830
No!

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:07.770
Take this!

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:08.400
What the?

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:09.040
What's that?

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:12.920
I want to investigate the connection between your psyche and the Ideon's power output.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:15.560
Put these inside your helmets!

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:16.720
Will these be useful?

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:19.200
We need data to research the Ideon.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.100
Didn't you want me to do more research?

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:21.830
I get it.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.350
Give it to the others too!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:24.320
Yeah.

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:31.790
Can we really find out anything with this?

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.650
An explosion? Or the stardust?

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:43.350
Are they serious about entering the stardust?

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:43.990
Yes!

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.540
We have no choice then.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.750
Zurow Jicks!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.500
Can you reach the enemy ship?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:53.240
We can try, but I think it's impossible to attack them directly!

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.240
Even planting a tracking device is good.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.330
Proceed!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:57.280
Yes sir!

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:00.780
Unit One and the Zero Number units! Approaching the enemy ship!

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:21.070
Huh?!

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:23.140
The Sol Conver's hatch isn't opening...

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:23.930
Bridge!

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.870
The hatch won't open, what's going on?

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:27.580
It got hit by the stardust.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.310
The Sol Conver did? How?

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.020
You must have gotten disconnected.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:32.790
No way!

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:35.000
We can't defeat the Buff Clan like this!

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.040
Get on Cosmo's Sol Amber!

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.820
If you dock, you can reach the cockpit!

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:41.870
Escaping here was futile in the first place!

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:42.560
Shut up!

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:43.940
Fine, whatever!

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:55.610
Enemy behind us, port side! Shoot!

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.010
If you're gonna kill me,

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.960
then do it without hesitation!

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:18.280
Cosmo, hurry up and launch! Get me to the Sol Conver!

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.740
Yeah, I got it!

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:20.770
Let's go!

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:25.620
Where's the Sol Conver?

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:26.720
To the upper right!

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:31.350
It's over there?!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.420
Behind us?

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.730
Moera! Launch the Sol Vanier!

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:40.510
We can't let the enemy notice the Sol Conver is unmanned!

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.410
I know, we need to get there fast!

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:47.830
Sorry for the wait, Cosmo!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.550
I'm launching the Sol Vanier!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.560
Zero-2 is down!

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:03.730
Shoot out the tracking devices!

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.810
One unit has reached the Sol Conver!

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:12.670
The stardust torrent is close!

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:15.320
Anti-Air Cannons, target the stardust and enemy units!

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:19.860
The Giant machines are over there!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.890
Sir Guhaba! Can you hear me?

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:26.010
I've found the Giant machines! Commencing attack!

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:27.490
Todawa! Listen to me!

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:29.930
You've entered the Nimbus Zone torrent!

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:31.830
Don't overdo it! I have a plan!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.790
But if they turn into the Giant...

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.080
This is suicidal!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.750
No ship can make it through the Nimbus Zone!

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:43.730
The Ideon units have gotten separated from the Solo Ship.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.000
But...

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.040
Karala. Tell me!

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:54.930
How is it that the Buff Clan can detect
us from thousands of light years away?

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:56.850
Well, I don't know.

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:58.430
Told you so, Bes.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:00.330
I'm sorry.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:16.520
Techno!

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:17.650
Make sure you hit them!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:19.630
Don't let the stardust distract you!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:21.860
They're chasing us!

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:24.030
Cosmo, we're nearing the Sol Conver!

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:24.430
Okay!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.730
I won't let you turn into the Giant!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.220
Vent!

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:35.750
Can't we bring back the Sol Conver by remote control?

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:36.930
We can't do it now!

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:37.690
Okay!

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.060
Let's get a little closer.

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:41.590
I'll let Kasha handle the Sol Amber's controls.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:42.980
Huh? What are you going to do?

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:44.510
I'm getting on the Sol Conver.

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:45.970
Inside the stardust?

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:47.180
We have no choice.

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.660
The Buff Clan is chasing us!

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:49.590
Lets go!

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:52.270
It's coming!

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:53.090
Okay!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:01.730
Okay!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.390
Damn it!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.670
This time, you're mine!

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:19.020
I'll take down the Giant and it's pilot!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:20.770
He's aiming at me!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:21.980
It's no good!

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:24.500
For the glory of Guhaba and Doba!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.010
Damn!

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:34.620
Okay! Docking into the Ideon!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:35.470
How's the gauge?!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.210
The Ideon gauge is on!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.170
Docking sign!

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:44.780
I see.

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:49.840
With the docking barrier, we can combine without problem even inside the stardust!

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:50.590
Kasha!

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:51.870
Get the Sol-Amber in front!

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:52.560
Roger!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.310
The Ideon has transformed!

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:15.990
Okay!

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:19.430
Let's get through the stardust with the Ideon in front of us!

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:23.350
Kasha! I'm coming there right now!

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:26.650
Cosmo!

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.280
Shouldn't we shoot away the stardust?

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:30.490
Don't fire. The enemy will see us!

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:31.230
Okay.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:33.830
Switch with me.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.150
It's all yours, Cosmo!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.640
Thank you.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.490
For letting us dock with the Sol Conver.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.730
We all need to survive, right?

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:42.400
I agree.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.750
Damn it!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.560
The signal device is operating!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:02.420
The Logo Dau aliens are trying to escape
from the flow of the Nimbus Zone!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.880
Okay, keep pursuing them!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:12.540
The Zero Zurow units are being sunk!

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:14.020
There's no helping it.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:19.060
We'll avenge our fallen comrades by
taking down the Logo Dau aliens!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.050
Do you think the Solo Ship can pull through?

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:30.030
I don't know!

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.510
The enemy ship's in our third attack range.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.700
How did they avoid the Nimbus Zone?

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:46.770
Is it because of the Ide's power, as Lady Harulu said?

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:48.100
We should be able to see them!

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:54.490
Here they come!

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:57.950
The Zurow Jicks will attack the ship while the Zigg Mack fights the Giant!

00:15:57.950 --> 00:15:58.780
Roger!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.360
All Zurow units, target the enemy ship!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:04.850
What?

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:06.240
A barrier?

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.400
They're being protected by a barrier?!

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.260
We're leaving the stardust torrent!

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:19.790
Stay alert, just in case!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.030
It's all thanks to the Ideon's Barrier!

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:26.460
We're escaping from the stardust!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.500
In addition, we might have shaken off the Buff Clan.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.170
Bes!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:31.310
It all went better than we expected.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:33.860
Karala! Are you injured?!

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:34.660
I'm okay.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.260
It was when the ship shook.

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:43.220
Impossible! Is it the Buff Clan?!

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:44.210
An ambush?

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:45.560
How did they find us?

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:54.830
Is Lotta okay in the field?

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:56.890
I'll go search for her!

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:57.950
Please do, Deck!

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.270
It's a direct hit!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.840
Damn! It's gonna tear through the armor!

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:16.190
Did we wear out the barrier while escaping the stardust?

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.650
The Ideon gauge's power is down!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:28.740
Four direct hits from a Glen Cannon!

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:31.040
They're shooting again!

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:39.950
It's Lotta!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:41.010
Lotta!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.260
A pistol?

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.220
Lotta!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:50.460
What the?!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:51.440
Deck!

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:52.670
Get out of the way!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.240
Lotta!

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.630
Banda Lotta?!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.920
Sir Guhaba! The Giant is reeling!

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:02.220
Good! Finish them with a claw attack!

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.470
Aim at the spot where they got hit!

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:08.950
It should have gotten weak!

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:10.270
They're coming!

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.060
No!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:12.060
Why won't it move?!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:17.130
Kasha!

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:17.780
Techno!

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:18.780
What are you doing?

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:20.460
Shoot! Shoot!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:23.910
The shoulder!

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:32.120
Attack with the Particle Cannon!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:32.880
Take this!

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:35.310
You won't defeat me!

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:37.420
What?!

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:40.560
I'll destroy you!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.100
How was that?

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.320
Get off!

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:57.320
How's the Solo Ship?!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.620
The Zigg Mack has been destroyed!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.240
All units, return to the Dorowa Zan!

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:17.520
Why, Lotta?

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.060
Why do you want to shoot Karala?!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:21.820
Are they in the forest?

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:22.420
Yes.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:23.890
They told not to enter!

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:29.220
It's wrong to take revenge on her, Lotta.

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:32.580
Karala is already cooperating with us...

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.620
I don't care about that!

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:38.950
If the Buff Clan hadn't come, Solo would still be peaceful!

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:42.750
Karala and the others killed our family and friends!

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.220
And you say she's our friend?

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:46.480
Part of the crew?

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:47.660
Never!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.720
I won't allow it!

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:52.930
I can't let Karala wander the ship as she pleases!

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:55.010
That's right...

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:56.640
I understand.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.460
How could you understand!?

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.910
I don't need your false sympathy!

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:02.050
I understand!

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:04.160
If you understand, then die!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:06.110
Let me have my revenge!

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:08.360
No!

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:10.470
It doesn't matter.

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:11.410
Karala!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:13.700
Go ahead and shoot me!

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:14.950
Banda Lotta!

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:20.960
Bes, do not worry about me.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:22.960
I understand.

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.020
What's happening?

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:42.270
Don't come in! Look away!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.610
Stay where you are!

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:05.110
Aim properly, Banda Lotta!

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.380
I am aiming!

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:27.090
The bullets...

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:28.860
I'm out of bullets!

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.140
I'm out of bullets!

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.320
Bullets...

00:21:35.970 --> 00:21:36.820
Lotta...

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:40.580
The bullets won't come out!

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:43.620
The bullets won't come out!

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:00.010
How sad...

00:22:09.670 --> 00:22:11.480
Everyone looks so solemn.

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:14.170
Karala, Lotta...

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:17.450
Bes and Sheryl...

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:25.220
So miserably solemn.

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:32.760
No person can live by endless hatred alone.

00:22:33.490 --> 00:22:36.390
Cosmo and Kasha...

00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:41.560
have witnessed such a frame of mind inside Lotta.

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:53.680
<i>Cosmo gets trapped into the middle of a violent attack.</i>

00:22:54.090 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>Having lost his will to fight,</i>

00:22:55.640 --> 00:22:58.910
<i>he is warmly greeted by Camyula at the Braziler Base.</i>

00:22:59.970 --> 00:23:03.850
<i>But, after seeing her get blown away by an explosion,</i>

00:23:03.850 --> 00:23:06.190
<i>Cosmo stands up again.</i>

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:09.850
<i>Strike down the new mobile mecha!</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:15.070
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon: "Doku's Attack Strategy"</i>

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:17.580
